                    <format attr='background-color' value='#ef7336' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6818' id='10' type-v2='text' w='50000' x='24968' y='727'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='18'>Guidelines</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin-top' value='2' />
                    <format attr='margin-bottom' value='2' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#ef7336' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='378' h='6818' id='282' is-fixed='true' name='All-Last updated' show-title='false' w='24516' x='74968' y='727'>
                  <layout-cache type-h='cell' type-w='cell' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='2' />
                    <format attr='margin-left' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='88161' id='756' type-v2='text' w='98968' x='516' y='7545'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef7336' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>Note:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>1. DHSE Employees- Any employee outside of Tomaso&apos;s hierarchy</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>2. Attrition by manager- Shows attrition for </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12' italic='true'>all reports </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>under the Manager based on current Supervisory Org</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef7336' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>Data set:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>1. All data is reflective of Workday</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>2. Dashboard information is provided upto end of Previous month</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef7336' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>Exclusions:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>1. DHSE employees are excluded</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef7336' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>Definitions:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>Dimension</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>A dimension is a categorical variable or attribute that provides context or categorizes data. It is often used to segment and group data. Examples of dimensions include country, department, gender, level, tenure, and other qualitative attributes.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>Metric</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>A metric is a quantitative measure or numerical value used to assess and quantify aspects of performance or behavior. Metrics are typically the values or data points that you want to analyze or track. Examples of metrics include attrition numbers, attrition rates, and other quantitative indicators.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef7336' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>Regrettable/ Non-regrettable:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>Non-regrettable:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>1. All Mutually agreed terminations (MSAs) and ordinary/extraordinary Termination would be Involuntary &amp; Unregrettable</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>2. All Involuntary Terminations should be tagged as non-regrettable (except unfortunate cases like Death)3. All employees exiting who have been rated as Under-performers in previous cycle, should be rated as Non-regrettable</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>4. All employees who have disciplinary actions against them (like Warning letters) and exit the company, should be rated as Non-regrettable</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>Regrettable:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>All other cases should be tagged as Regrettable</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='2360' id='625' name='guidelines' show-title='false' w='5503' x='93485' y='96404' />
      </zones>
